---
/**
 * Diagram 2 — the pipeline, with stage ownership.
 * Stage names and [A]/[C] ownership follow the repo's own vocabulary:
 * [A] is a stage the agent performs under a rubric, [C] one the CLI performs
 * deterministically.
 */
---

<figure class="dg">
  <div class="dg-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 640 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="pl-title pl-desc" class="dg-svg">
      <title id="pl-title">The research-scan pipeline, stage by stage</title>
      <desc id="pl-desc">
        Twelve steps in order: init (CLI), plan (agent), retrieve (CLI), screen (agent),
        expand (CLI), screen again on the expansion items (agent), coverage (CLI), an
        optional gap round, shortlist (CLI), rerank (agent), verify (CLI) and emit (CLI).
        Agent stages run under written rubrics; CLI stages are deterministic.
      </desc>

      <defs>
        <marker id="pl-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5"
                markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
          <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="dg-arrowhead" />
        </marker>
      </defs>

      <!-- Row 1 -->
      <g>
        <rect x="26"  y="30" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node" />
        <text x="92"  y="55" class="dg-node-name">init</text>
        <text x="92"  y="75" class="dg-node-owner">[C] CLI</text>

        <rect x="178" y="30" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node dg-node-agent" />
        <text x="244" y="55" class="dg-node-name">plan</text>
        <text x="244" y="75" class="dg-node-owner">[A] agent</text>

        <rect x="330" y="30" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node" />
        <text x="396" y="55" class="dg-node-name">retrieve</text>
        <text x="396" y="75" class="dg-node-owner">[C] CLI</text>

        <rect x="482" y="30" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node dg-node-agent" />
        <text x="548" y="55" class="dg-node-name">screen</text>
        <text x="548" y="75" class="dg-node-owner">[A] 0–3</text>
      </g>
      <line x1="158" y1="59" x2="176" y2="59" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <line x1="310" y1="59" x2="328" y2="59" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <line x1="462" y1="59" x2="480" y2="59" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <path d="M 614 59 H 628 V 123 H 92 V 154" class="dg-flow dg-wrap" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />

      <!-- Row 2 -->
      <g>
        <rect x="26"  y="160" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node" />
        <text x="92"  y="185" class="dg-node-name">expand</text>
        <text x="92"  y="205" class="dg-node-owner">[C] CLI</text>

        <rect x="178" y="160" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node dg-node-agent" />
        <text x="244" y="185" class="dg-node-name">screen</text>
        <text x="244" y="205" class="dg-node-owner">[A] expansion</text>

        <rect x="330" y="160" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node" />
        <text x="396" y="185" class="dg-node-name">coverage</text>
        <text x="396" y="205" class="dg-node-owner">[C] CLI</text>

        <rect x="482" y="160" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node dg-node-optional" />
        <text x="548" y="185" class="dg-node-name">gap round</text>
        <text x="548" y="205" class="dg-node-owner">at most once</text>
      </g>
      <line x1="158" y1="189" x2="176" y2="189" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <line x1="310" y1="189" x2="328" y2="189" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <line x1="462" y1="189" x2="480" y2="189" class="dg-flow dg-flow-dashed" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <path d="M 614 189 H 628 V 253 H 92 V 284" class="dg-flow dg-wrap" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />

      <!-- Row 3 -->
      <g>
        <rect x="26"  y="290" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node" />
        <text x="92"  y="315" class="dg-node-name">shortlist</text>
        <text x="92"  y="335" class="dg-node-owner">[C] CLI</text>

        <rect x="178" y="290" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node dg-node-agent" />
        <text x="244" y="315" class="dg-node-name">rerank</text>
        <text x="244" y="335" class="dg-node-owner">[A] agent</text>

        <rect x="330" y="290" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node" />
        <text x="396" y="315" class="dg-node-name">verify</text>
        <text x="396" y="335" class="dg-node-owner">[C] every DOI</text>

        <rect x="482" y="290" width="132" height="58" rx="8" class="dg-node dg-node-out" />
        <text x="548" y="315" class="dg-node-name">emit</text>
        <text x="548" y="335" class="dg-node-owner">[C] CLI</text>
      </g>
      <line x1="158" y1="319" x2="176" y2="319" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <line x1="310" y1="319" x2="328" y2="319" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />
      <line x1="462" y1="319" x2="480" y2="319" class="dg-flow" marker-end="url(#pl-arrow)" />

      <!-- Legend -->
      <g>
        <rect x="26" y="392" width="18" height="18" rx="4" class="dg-node dg-node-agent" />
        <text x="52" y="406" class="dg-legend">[A] agent stage, under a written rubric</text>
        <rect x="330" y="392" width="18" height="18" rx="4" class="dg-node" />
        <text x="356" y="406" class="dg-legend">[C] deterministic CLI stage</text>
        <rect x="26" y="424" width="18" height="18" rx="4" class="dg-node dg-node-optional" />
        <text x="52" y="438" class="dg-legend">conditional — runs only when coverage is thin</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="dg-caption">
    Every stage is idempotent and re-runnable: change an input file, re-run from the
    stage it affects. The gap round only adds — round one's papers and scores are
    never discarded.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dg { margin: 1.75rem 0; }
  .dg-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dg-svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 440px;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--pf-font-sans);
  }
  .dg-node { fill: var(--pf-surface); stroke: var(--pf-border-muted); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .dg-node-agent { fill: var(--pf-accent-soft); stroke: var(--pf-accent); }
  .dg-node-optional { fill: var(--pf-background); stroke: var(--pf-border-muted); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .dg-node-out { fill: var(--pf-surface); stroke: var(--pf-text-muted); stroke-width: 2; }
  .dg-node-name {
    fill: var(--pf-text-strong);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-anchor: middle;
    font-family: var(--pf-font-mono);
  }
  .dg-node-owner { fill: var(--pf-text-muted); font-size: 13.5px; text-anchor: middle; }
  .dg-flow { stroke: var(--pf-text-muted); stroke-width: 1.75; fill: none; }
  .dg-flow-dashed { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .dg-wrap { stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .dg-arrowhead { fill: var(--pf-text-muted); }
  .dg-legend { fill: var(--pf-text-muted); font-size: 15px; }
  .dg-caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--pf-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>
